{"catalog_version": 1, "point_id": "NP-1", "task_id": "corpus-01-Land-Use-NP-1-A-1-zh", "fields": {"claim": "56b8ef2490cc7a5b9efc36e0d955b58217be854b145fd902ca5f9ee5e05f6de2", "claim_en": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "technical_features[0]": "e8db154dac4db66a719402221cbbc8b73eef19c5a8d97c4224480081a2911e89", "technical_features[1]": "ddf0db999fe6f737694684dc9d62ef8f0708d08cac5d036f1c841eddce3c1503", "technical_features[2]": "51f1b5dcb38c004a5ebfc4ce62706037eefd50575c3ef44dec132e6ca73a0047"}, "sources": [{"source_id": "S-3b56e98353fcacb4-001", "field": "claim", "field_index": null, "language": "zh", "start": 0, "end": 58, "text": "将图像识别预训练卷积神经网络迁移到高分辨率RGB正射遥感影像的土地利用与覆盖分类，并结合适合地理空间数据的数据增强。", "sha256": "56b8ef2490cc7a5b9efc36e0d955b58217be854b145fd902ca5f9ee5e05f6de2"}, {"source_id": "S-3b56e98353fcacb4-002", "field": "technical_features", "field_index": 0, "language": "zh", "start": 0, "end": 31, "text": "以可见光RGB高空间分辨率正射影像作为土地利用与覆盖分类输入。", "sha256": "e8db154dac4db66a719402221cbbc8b73eef19c5a8d97c4224480081a2911e89"}, {"source_id": "S-3b56e98353fcacb4-003", "field": "technical_features", "field_index": 1, "language": "zh", "start": 0, "end": 43, "text": "将ImageNet任务学到的深度网络迁移到遥感分类，以减少对大规模遥感标注数据的依赖。", "sha256": "ddf0db999fe6f737694684dc9d62ef8f0708d08cac5d036f1c841eddce3c1503"}, {"source_id": "S-3b56e98353fcacb4-004", "field": "technical_features", "field_index": 2, "language": "zh", "start": 0, "end": 32, "text": "加入适合地理空间数据的数据增强，并在未见过的影像数据上检验泛化。", "sha256": "51f1b5dcb38c004a5ebfc4ce62706037eefd50575c3ef44dec132e6ca73a0047"}]}